  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HSS GRANT FOR BENIN - Benin (01-Jul-2014-30-Jun-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Benin, RSSH, Health System Performance Program (HSPP)This program has the following goals: By 2017, contribute to the achievement of the MDGs 4 (infant mortality), 5 (maternal mortality) and 6 (HIV, TB and malaria) through the strengthening of health systems. The objectives of this program are: Improve the allocative efficiciency of the health budget.  Increase coverage of quality maternal, neonatal and children services, as well as preventive and treatment services for HIV, TB and malaria in the 19 health zones supported by the Global Fund.  Strengthen the health system to ensure better coverage of health services</narrative>
  </description>
